## Spec B6 (docs/specs/stdlib/async.spec.md): a class that overrides
## `poll` with a return type other than `Poll[Self.Output]` (here
## bare `Int`) should be rejected. Same disclaimer as
## `async_negative_missing_output.rx` — the mixin-signature checker
## is not wired against `include` sites yet, so the test using this
## fixture is `#[ignore]`d.

class WrongPollSig
  include Future
  type Output = Int

  def var poll(cx: &var Context) -> Int
    0
  end
end

def main
  let _f = WrongPollSig.new
  puts "should-not-compile"
end
